  "content": "\n\n<p>「Iris」的非官方分支，專為與 FML 相容而設計</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>此模組需搭配 Beddium 模組使用，下載連結如下：<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/beddium\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/beddium</a></p>\n<p>目前雖無 1.21.1 的正式版，但此處提供存檔版本。我已聯繫開發者，他表示將會重新發布：<a href=\"https://github.com/peaksuperior885/Thorbedium/releases\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://github.com/peaksuperior885/Thorbedium/releases</a></p>\n<p>\n  <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fforgeoculus\" rel=\"nofollow\">\n      <img src=\"https://api.tomas65107.dev/cdn/platformdecals/modrinth.png\" width=\"220\">\n  </a>\n\n  <a href=\"https://github.com/peaksuperior885/ForgeOculus\" rel=\"nofollow\">\n      <img src=\"https://api.tomas65107.dev/cdn/platformdecals/github.png\" width=\"220\">\n  </a>\n\n  <a href=\"https://discord.gg/Uuxy92JNF3\" rel=\"nofollow\">\n      <img src=\"https://api.tomas65107.dev/cdn/platformdecals/discord.png\" width=\"220\">\n  </a>\n</p>",
